{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8d89ff519236e3e2","name":"Cybot Galactica","source":{"id":"source:reference-8d89ff519236e3e2","title":"Cybot Galactica","revision":24489,"timestamp":"2024-11-03T15:27:50Z","sha256":"1e4c6cd39e9378e84f9b21a2db819af03eded92eae0d8f2fc86ddee11795876b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24489","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Cybot%20Galactica&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8d89ff519236e3e2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Cybot Galactica dominates the nonmilitary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," market, excelling in both design and marketing. Although its prices match its prestige, Cybot Galactica's customer service and repair service span the galaxy. All major and most lesser Republic and Imperial worlds hold at least one official Cybot sales and service center. Cybot is a major player in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Corporate Sector"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Corporate_Sector?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and wields considerable political influence in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Core Worlds"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Core_Worlds?action=edit&redlink=1"}," as well. Cybot utilizes ",{"tag":"a","children":["Telti"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Telti","referenceId":"reference:83d5ffdea6efb2a1"}," facilities as well as those on the planet ",{"tag":"a","children":["Affa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Affa?action=edit&redlink=1"}," for its protocol division.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Manufacturer Traits:"]}," Cybot systems are so commonplace that nondroid heroes with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus (Mechanics)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Mechanics)"}," can modify or repair Cybot Droids in half the time that would be required for a normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," (see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Modifying Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Modifying_Droids"},"). This does not stack with any other ability that saves modification or repair time. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," does not gain this benefit when modifying itself.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
